 IB43:{src:"GaDOE Item Bank 43A2024 · DOK 3", stem:`<p>A company buys a machine for $4,000. Its value depreciates 10 percent each year. What is the machine worth after 4 years? Round to the nearest cent.</p>`,
  type:"num", fields:[["Value ($)",2624.40,0.011]], tagFor:v => v===2400 ? "Subtracted 10% of the original value each year (linear)" : Math.abs(v-0.4)<0.01 ? "Used the rate 0.10 as the factor" : "Exponential decay error",
  why:"y = 4000(1 − 0.10)<sup>x</sup> = 4000(0.9)<sup>x</sup>. After 4 years: 4000(0.9)<sup>4</sup> = 4000(0.6561) = $2,624.40."},
 IB44:{src:"GaDOE Item Bank 44A2024 · DOK 2", stem:`<p>In cell reproduction, there are 2 cells after day 1, 4 after day 2, 8 after day 3, and so on. How many cells will there be on the 20th day?</p>`,
