 IB53:{src:"GaDOE Item Bank 53A2024 · DOK 3", stem:`<p>Class A scores: 62, 90, 42, 92, 88, 84, 91, 87, 97, 100. Class B scores: 75, 80, 78, 85, 90, 82, 88, 84, 81, 87.</p><p>Which class has the greater variability, measured by standard deviation?</p>`,
  type:"mc", opts:[["A","Class A",""],["B","Class B","Judged spread by the mean instead of by distance from the mean"]], ans:"A",
  why:"The means are almost equal (83.3 and 83.0), but Class A's scores sit much farther from the mean: 42 and 62 are far below it. Class A's SD is about 16.86; Class B's is about 4.45."},
 IB56M:{src:"GaDOE Item Bank 56A2024, Part B · DOK 3", stem:`<p>Hours studied in a week: 4, 6, 7, 8, 8, 9, 10, 10, 11, 12, 14, 18, 22, 25. What is the median?</p>`,
  type:"num", fields:[["Median",10,0.001]], tagFor:v => Math.abs(v-11.71)<0.05 ? "Computed the mean instead of the median" : "Median error (with 14 values, average the 7th and 8th)",
